/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,5\ngrep ',Geometry,' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,5\n```\n\n按关键词找（例如勾股定理相关）：\n\n```bash\ngrep -i 'pythagorean' references/standards.csv | cut -d',' -f1,2,5\n```\n\n`requirement` 字段里含逗号，所以取整行文本时用 `grep` 原样输出，别用 `cut` 切到第 5 列以后。\n\n## 回答约定\n\n- 引用课标要求时给出**原文**（英文）加编号，必要时再翻译。\n- 一并给出 `grade` / `domain` 和 `pdf_page`，方便回到 PDF 核对。\n- 表里没有的条目直说没有，不要照编号规律臆造。\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788753267933},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The skill tells me to look at references/standards.csv. Let me first look at the index for grade 7, and search for relevant standards about proportional relationships, ratios, percents (discount problems), and constant of proportionality.\n\nThe lesson points:\n1. 用比例关系解决折扣问题 (use proportional relationships to solve discount/multi-step percent problems) — likely 7.RP.3\n2. 由两个量的表格判断是否成正比例 (from a table of two quantities, decide whether proportional) — likely 7.RP.2a\n3. 求比例常数并写出方程 (find constant of proportionality and write equation) — likely 7.RP.2b / 7.RP.2c\n\nThe cluster 7.RP.2 has sub-standards a, b, c, d. Let me check the data.\n\nLet me run greps.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"我来查询 7 年级比例相关的课标。先看总览和 RP 域的条目。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_59b4113cdece42b3a469984f","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /Users/l/other_git_repos/calculus-quest/nodejs_react_lib/learn-claude-code/custom_skill_space/math-standards && grep '^7,' references/index.md; grep '^7.RP' references/standards.csv"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"ark-plan","model":"glm-5.3","usage":{"input":615,"output":270,"cacheRead":2304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":3189,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":0},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788753267935,"responseId":"021788753268001b9f489096afc36acf45c00ec3935d23a7b0a1f","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_59b4113cdece42b3a469984f","toolName":"bas